UR  - https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/10934148/
N1  - [ref44] Early Access, March 2025. Proposes PSMMoEs — metric-learning gating within MoE framework for multisource unsupervised domain adaptation in intelligent fault diagnosis. Uses deep point-to-set distance metric to assign target samples to source-domain experts. Venue hint in task brief was incorrect (Springer Complex & Intelligent Systems); verified venue is IEEE TNNLS. Differentiation from H6 M3: uses metric-learning gating for cross-domain fault classification with multiple labelled source domains; M3 uses early-cycle attention gating for RUL regression in a single unlabelled dataset.
